<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include("../partials/head")%>
    <title>Document</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/frontend/public/css/photoshoot.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include("../partials/header")%>

    <h1 class="heading">___Book Your Maternity Photoshoot____</h1>
    <section class="container">
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="grid-item">
          <a href="#">
            <img src="/frontend/public/Images/photoshoot/one.JPG" alt="" />
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="img-info">
          <a href="#"> </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="grid-item">
          <a href="#">
            <img src="/frontend/public/Images/photoshoot/two.JPG" alt="" />
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="img-info">
          <a href="#"> </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="grid-item">
          <a href="#">
            <img src="/frontend/public/Images/photoshoot/three.jpg" alt="" />
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="img-info">
          <a href="#"> </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="grid-item">
          <a href="#">
            <img src="/frontend/public/Images/photoshoot/four.JPG" alt="" />
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="img-info">
          <a href="#"></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="outer-section">
      <section class="container2">
        <h1>For booking Please fill the form below..</h1>
        <form class="contact-form">
          <label for="Name">Name</label>
          <input
            type="text"
            id="Name"
            size="52"
            placeholder="Enter name"
            required
          />

          <label for="email">Email</label>
          <input
            type="email"
            id="email"
            size="52"
            placeholder="Enter email"
            required
          />

          <label for="phone">Phone</label>
          <input
            type="text"
            id="phone"
            size="52"
            placeholder="Enter phone no."
            required
          />

          <label for="address">Address</label>
          <textarea id="address" cols="50" rows="10" required></textarea>

          <label for="image">Images</label>
          <input class="file" size="100" type="file" id="image" required />

          <button class="btn">Submit</button>
        </form>
      </section>
      <div class="side-img">
        <img src="/frontend/public/Images/photoshoot/three.jpg" alt="" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container3">
      <div class="side-img1">
        <img src="/frontend/public/Images/photoshoot/one.JPG" alt="" />
      </div>

      <div class="terms">
        <h1 class="Conditions">Terms & Conditions</h1>
        <ul class="list">
          <li>Candidate entries are accepted from all over India.</li>
          <li>All candidates will be rewarded with a GIFT voucher.</li>
          <li>
            Selection and Short listing of the participants will not be biased
            i.e. it will be under the sole discretion of WingsEstilo.com, based
            on the confident gesture and elegance.
          </li>
          <li>
            The selected candidates will be communicated through Mobile Phones
            and E-mail and pass on further details regarding the photo shoot and
            its venue.
          </li>
          <li>
            The venue and the probs to be used will be decided by the delegates
            of Wings Estilo Maternity Wear.
          </li>
          <li>
            Outfits for the Maternity shoot can be chosen from WingsEstilo.com.
            or from the outlets of Wings Estilo Maternity Wear.
          </li>
          <li>
            The Maternity photoshoot will be conducted in Gwalior only. The
            Maternity shoot can be served only for the applicants who are
            willing to travel to Gwalior.
          </li>
          <li>
            Each candidate profile will be analyzed separately, so fake profiles
            are not acceptable or entertained.
          </li>
          <li>
            The photographs from the Maternity Photoshoot will be displayed in
            the official website and Facebook page of WingsEstilo
            (WingsEstilo.com).
          </li>
          <li>
            The candidates who participated once are strictly restricted from
            new entry.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Pre-Wedding Section -->

    <section class="pre-wedding-section">
      <h1 class="heading1">Book Your Pre-Wedding Shoot</h1>
      <div class="pre-wedding-img">
        <img src="/frontend/public/Images/photoshoot/Pw1.jpg" alt="" />
        <img src="/frontend/public/Images/photoshoot/Pw5.jpg" alt="" />
        <img src="/frontend/public/Images/photoshoot/Pw2.jpg" alt="" />
        <img src="/frontend/public/Images/photoshoot/Pw4.jpg" alt="" />
      </div>

      <div class="showcase">
        <div class="left-para">
          <p>
            "Every love story is distinct, and our pre-wedding photoshoots are
            tailored to reflect the individuality of each couple. Whether you
            envision a whimsical fairytale romance, a rustic countryside affair,
            or a sleek urban rendezvous, our team works closely with you to
            bring your vision to life. From selecting enchanting locations to
            curating the perfect props and outfits, we ensure that every element
            aligns seamlessly with your story."
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="right">
          <img
            class="img"
            src="/frontend/public/Images/photoshoot/Pw2.jpg"
            alt=""
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="showcase">
        <div class="right">
          <img
            class="img"
            src="/frontend/public/Images/photoshoot/Pw4.jpg"
            alt=""
          />
        </div>
        <div class="left-para">
          <p>
            "At [Wings Estilo], we are passionate about crafting unforgettable
            experiences and creating art that transcends time. Allow us to be a
            part of your love story, and together, let's embark on a journey of
            laughter, romance, and everlasting memories. Contact us today to
            learn more about our pre-wedding photoshoot packages and start
            envisioning the magic that awaits."
          </p>
          <div>
            <a href="#">
              <button class="book-btn">Book Now</button>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="pre-wedding-section">
      <h1 class="heading1">Book Your E-commerce PhotoShoot</h1>
      <div class="pre-wedding-img">
        <img src="/frontend/public/Images/photoshoot/Ec1.JPG" alt="" />
        <img src="/frontend/public/Images/photoshoot/Ec2.JPG" alt="" />
        <img src="/frontend/public/Images/photoshoot/Ec3.jpg" alt="" />
        <img src="/frontend/public/Images/photoshoot/Ec7.jpg" alt="" />
      </div>

      <div class="showcase">
        <div class="left-para">
          <p>
            "In today's competitive market, compelling visuals can make all the
            difference in driving sales and engagement. Our e-commerce
            photoshoots are designed to do just that, helping you attract more
            customers, increase conversions, and stand out from the competition.
            Whether you're launching a new product or revamping your online
            store, our images will help you captivate your audience and leave a
            lasting impression. (Make it simple and short)"
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="right">
          <img
            class="img"
            src="/frontend/public/Images/photoshoot/Ec4.jpg"
            alt=""
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="showcase">
        <div class="right">
          <img
            class="img"
            src="/frontend/public/Images/photoshoot/Ec7.jpg"
            alt=""
          />
        </div>
        <div class="left-para">
          <p>
            "At [Wings Estlio], we're passionate about helping brands thrive in
            the digital age. Partner with us for your e-commerce photoshoot
            needs, and let's elevate your online presence together. Contact us
            today to learn more about our services and take the first step
            toward unlocking the full potential of your brand in the digital
            marketplace."
          </p>
          <div>
            <a href="#">
              <button class="book-btn">Book Now</button>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <!-- footer -->
    <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
  </body>
</html>
